          "• Ability to solve multi-stage analytical problems using subqueries.",
          "• Practical string, date and numeric transformation.",
          "• Advanced analytical SQL using window functions.",
          "• Ranking, segmentation and distribution analysis.",
          "• Pivot-style reporting through conditional aggregation.",
          "• Statistical problem-solving including median-style SQL logic.",
          "• Transaction control and reversible database operations.",
