          "The project is built around a main dashboard named “Help Desk | Weekly Analysis”, a Help Desk datasource, a dedicated Parameters source, KPI worksheets, analytical breakdowns and parameter/action-driven interactions. The supplied source document identifies the packaged Tableau workbook as the source of truth for the dashboard structure, fields, calculations, parameters and analytical techniques. fileciteturn58file0L7-L19"
