          "The dashboard is centered around the parameter “PARA | Selected Week”. The supplied workbook documentation identifies its packaged value as 2020-07-06. The calculated field “CALC | Selected Week Boolean” evaluates whether a ticket's Created Date belongs to the selected week.",
          "The core weekly logic uses DATETRUNC('week', [created_date]) so ticket dates are normalized to a common weekly grain. This selected-week boolean becomes the foundation for the KPI calculations and selected-week-versus-overall comparisons."
