          "The implementation is organized as a modular automation workflow rather than a single scraping script. Browser/page handling, extraction logic, Excel input/output and utility functions are separated into dedicated modules, making the solution easier to maintain and extend. The core workflow uses Playwright for browser automation and Pandas/openpyxl for structured Excel processing. fileciteturn46file2L1-L6"
